      <li><a href="/en/blog/amed-direct-bookings-website/" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">How Dive Shops and Villas in Amed, Karangasem Can Win Direct Bookings Online</a></li>
      <li><a href="/en/blog/medewi-surf-camps-website-guide/" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">Getting Found on Google: A Website Guide for Medewi Surf Camps and Jembrana Producers</a></li>
      <li><a href="/en/harga/" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">Website Pricing at zeepage</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="bg-ink text-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 sm:p-12 mt-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Ready to take bookings on your own surf school website?</h2>
          <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">Tell us about your school on WhatsApp: your breaks, your lesson types, and how bookings reach you today. We will suggest the simplest website that moves those bookings to you, free of charge and with no obligation.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href={WA_EN} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-brand text-white rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 font-bold hover:bg-branddark transition">Free Consultation</a>
            <a href="/en/layanan/" class="border border-white/40 rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition">See Website Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer t={t.footer} lang={lang} navLinks={t.nav.links} id="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
